DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260103
SUMMARY:Friday (weekly fast)
DESCRIPTION:Old (Julian) Calendar observance\; churches on the New Calendar
  keep fixed feasts 13 days earlier. Wednesdays and Fridays are kept as fas
 t days all year\, except in the fast-free weeks.
END:VEVENT
